[Event "Openings"]
[ChapterName "Spanish"]

1. e4 {[%why Takes the centre with a pawn and frees the f1-bishop and the queen.]} e5
2. Nf3 {[%why Develops the knight and attacks the e5-pawn, so Black must defend it.]} Nc6
3. Bb5 {[%why After 2...Nc6 the bishop attacks the knight that defends e5.]} *

[Event "Openings"]
[Opening "Petrov Defence"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nf6
3. Nxe5 {[%why After 2...Nf6 White simply takes the e5-pawn, which is no longer defended.]} *
